{
  "text": "Why does changing one line rebuild all the layers after it?",
  "author": "Aigerim",
  "topic_id": "{{topic_id}}"
}

{
  "text": "Each instruction is a layer; a changed layer invalidates the cache of every layer below it.",
  "author": "Nurkhan Tashimov"
}

{
  "text": "Docker caches layers top to bottom: copy requirements.txt before the source so pip install stays cached."
}
